<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;text-indent:1pt;">Blackboxstocks uses and intends to continue to use its Investors website at <u>https://.blackboxstocks.com/company-overview</u> as a means of disclosing material nonpublic information and for complying with its disclosure obligations under Regulation FD. Accordingly, investors should monitor the Company&#8217;s Investors website, in addition to following the Company&#8217;s press releases, SEC filings, public conference calls, presentations and webcasts.</p>

